rooms_desc ({"You are here.","As you stroll from the porch across the yard over to the cliffs...you notice the waves crashing up against the rocks below. As you look out towardsthe horizon you notice a beautiful sunset...the clouds of every colour streachacross the sky as dusk settles in.  Over head you can hear the calls of the seaguils. You feel totally at ease here, it is a very relaxed atmosphere. You feel as if nothing in the world could harm you here as the sweet ocean breeze blows across your face.","This is the entry room to Lynnes house. It is large and lavishwith stone walls, and a polished teak floor. Two large persianrugs flank a bay window to the south. Large archways lead westand north. The mahogony front door is east."," As you enter the room you are caught in a small shower, a gentle breeze is blown ruffling your hair. As you continue to walk into the room, you notice that the walls are made of the most lusious chocolate. You take note that there is is a beautiful ray of sunlight streaming through the hole in the wall which is in the shape of an Easter Egg, where Baer has been eatingat the wall. The floor is lined in a huge baer-skinned rug. You are surprised to see such a beautiful river flowing, peacefully though the middle of the room...as you look towards the center of the river you notice Baer's bed floatingin the river, where only he can get to it. As you look to the northeasterncornor of the room you notice and cute, cuddly penguin there, bouncing aroundlooking to be hugged. You notice shining coming from the floor, as you look closely you notice that they are pieces of colourful foil. Reds, greens,blues, silvers, and golds sparkle in the room. As you look up, trying to notethe ceiling, you come to the conclusion to give up because there doesnt seem to be one. But watchout for the banana pleel on the floor as you look around this wonderful room.","This is the lounge room of Lynnes house. It is large and comfortablewith a warming marble fireplace in the middle of the east wallIn the southeast is a pianola, and the northeast is a large olddesk. On the north wall is a large leather lounge, and the west wall has a set of book cabinets.To the south is a large double door leading to the bedroom, and an exitin between the bookcases leads west.","As you walk into the room you take notice of the huge bear-skinned rug surrounding the bed. The four poster bed is facing north with the headboardagainst the south wall. There is a long window above the headboard, letting the sun shine through during the day. To the west you notice a grand butlerscabinet. To the northeast is a huge fireplace, providing the only heat and occasionally the only light. To the east wall, south of the door, is an oldtapestry above the drysink. On each sides of the bed you notice lavish endtables. To the east there is a spa.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,})
rooms_short ({"Enterance point to Lynne's home.","  The cliffs over looking the ocean.","Entry hall to Lynnes House"," You have entered Baer's room. Lynne's loving son.","Lynnes Lounge Room","This is the master bedroom...(Lynne's and Cara's room)","A brand new room, ready to be decorated","A brand new room, ready to be decorated","A brand new room, ready to be decorated",0,})
