items ({({"sea","You can hear the seaguls scream over head and the waves crashing on the rocks below. As you look out towards the sea you feel drawn westward to take a closer look.","swing","This is an old, faded, white-washed wicker swing. It's large enough to fit two people comfortably. It invites you to sit with a loved one and relax while      looking out to sea","bushes","These are plump green junipers surrounding the porch, so not to make it look   bare. ",}),0,({"The room is a large entry hall, the walls are of stone","with two large persian rugs hanging on the south wall","surrounding a window. The floor is polished teak","and the walls are set with elaborte arches.",}),({"peel","As you look at the banana peel you get dizzy and start to lose your balance..*SPLASH!!* You've just fallen into the blue, crystal river..You are now soaking wet.",}),0,({"window","As you look at the window you notice that there is a design in the glass. The medal in the window is in a design of lattis.  During for most of the day the sun shines through the window..although not directly.",}),0,0,0,0,})
